<title>USA: Boehne says ultimate goal is sustainable growth.</title>
<headline>Boehne says ultimate goal is sustainable growth.</headline>
<dateline>BLOOMINGTON, Ind. 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philadelphia Federal Reserve President Edward Boehne said on Thursday that the ultimate objective of monetary or economic policy is maximum sustainable economic growth.</p>
<p>&quot;That's the bottom line we are trying to achieve,&quot; Boehne said, adding that sustainable economic growth will create a maximum standard of living.</p>
</text>
